*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Everything measure.py and the harness make on one machine: built sets, exports
work/

# The one probe that is over GitHub's 100 MB file limit and that no run uses; probes.py makes it
# on request (python tools/harness/probes.py gap30). Its manifest is kept.
probes/gap30.wav

# Live's renders of the runs and the bulky views analyse.py writes beside each result (CSV, impulse
# responses). Both are remade by the measurement (README > Measuring a device); the results/ next
# to them are what is kept.
devices/*/renders/
devices/*/extras/
automation/export/

# Live's own files in a generated set's Project folder
*.asd
Backup/
Ableton Project Info/

# written by tools/probe-device/build_patch.py
tools/probe-device/Suhina Probe.maxpat
tools/probe-device/clipboard.json

# Side-by-side comparison with Live (compare/): the samples (made by make_samples.py) and the sets with
# their projects, Live's exports and Suhina's renders are local; the scripts and the page are kept
compare/samples/
compare/sets/
